   "k": "h2",
   "t": "CSS Flexbox and Grid"
  },
  {
   "k": "p",
   "t": "CSS Flexbox and CSS Grid are layout models used in web design to create\n      responsive and flexible layouts."
  },
  {
   "k": "h3",
   "t": "CSS Flexbox"
  },
  {
   "k": "p",
   "t": "Flexbox is a one-dimensional layout model that arranges items in a row or\n      a column. It's particularly useful when you want your layout to respond to\n      different screen sizes."
  },
  {
   "k": "p",
   "t": "We have utility classes built-in for CSS Flexbox. Check out the examples\n      in \nStyles (CSS)."
  },
  {
   "k": "code",
   "t": "1.container {2    display: flex;3}"
  },
  {
   "k": "h4",
   "t": "Additional resources"
  },
