  },
  {
   "k": "h3",
   "t": "CSS Grid"
  },
  {
   "k": "p",
   "t": "CSS Grid is a two-dimensional layout model, and can handle both rows and\n      columns at a time. It's particularly useful when you want to create\n      complex, responsive designs."
  },
  {
   "k": "code",
   "t": "1.container {2    display: grid;3}"
  },
